Subject: [PATCH 02328/11362] [outer-loop] ARC progress: lp85 L3 -> L4
 (offline-reproduction-gated; total 13 -> 14)

Ran the standing ARC loop. lp85 advanced to a NEW reproduced level:
solve_adaptered(lp85, target_level=4) via the OfflineSolver + learned verifier
checkpoint reaches L4 -- full L1->L4 = 54 moves, 836 states, offline reproduction
gate reproduced=True / claimed_level=4, DETERMINISTIC on re-run. The prior L3 was
just the default target_level=3 cap, not a wall. Updated models/arc_verifier_lp85.json
(self-improved checkpoint), the artifact, and the registry: lp85 levels_reproduced
3->4, reproducible_total_levels 13->14 across 11 games.

Sweep also tried 4 unsolved shallow candidates (vc33/dc22/g50t/sb26) adapter-free at
the 12k discovery budget: NO L0 advance -- each needs per-game RE (consistent with
the prior PHASE C sweep). Honest net: +1 reproduced level (lp85 L4), 0 new games.
NO leaderboard submission (operator-only).
